+### Registration changes and related records {#h01-preregistration-deviations}
+
+```{r}
+#| label: tbl-h01-deviations
+#| tbl-cap: "H01 changes relative to the preregistered or otherwise expected analysis."
+
+deviations |>
+  rename(
+    `Deviation ID` = deviation_ids,
+    Topic = topic,
+    `Preregistered or expected` = registered_or_expected,
+    `Analysis used` = analysis_used
+  ) |>
+  h01_gt() |>
+  gt::cols_hide(columns = `Deviation ID`) |>
+  cols_width(
+    Topic ~ px(200),
+    `Preregistered or expected` ~ px(430),
+    `Analysis used` ~ px(540)
+  ) |>
+  tab_source_note(
+    md(
+      "The central registration record classifies each entry as a current scientific deviation, a current qualification, resolved implementation history, or technical provenance."
+    )
+  )
+```
